; A stand-in for the Z3 OCaml bindings, for the browser build of Lex.
; It covers only the part of the API that Lex's src/smt.ml uses. Instead of
; calling libz3 it prints SMT-LIB 2 text and hands it to a JavaScript
; function, globalThis.lexZ3Check, which runs the real Z3 (z3-solver, Wasm).
(library
 (name z3)
 (libraries js_of_ocaml))
